{"parse": {"title": "奠基物", "pageid": 40787, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"奠基物\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/43/CurrencyItem-100801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"奠基物\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>奠基物</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-100801 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/CurrencyIcon-100801_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-100801_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/CurrencyIcon-100801_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-100801_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/CurrencyIcon-100801_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-100801_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#1804</div></div><hr /><div>一颗燃烧的心。构成它的是黑金，汗水与奔涌的红河。可用于特别柜台兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">经由许许多多只手，长而又长的时间。我们把它带来了。它使冷钢烧熔，令亘古的冻土开口说话。于是这儿有了生活，有了那洪流所允诺的理想乡。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">再见，来亚什基·活动正篇</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "奠基物"}}